ced, which is how you know it worked.","kind":"work","weight":6,"seed":true,"i":2},{"tick":-1,"day":0,"time":"before","text":"Ledger, page one: \"Things I do not know.\" It is the longest page.","kind":"origin","weight":8,"seed":true,"i":3}],"relationships":{"bram":45,"tam":45},"pressure":{},"prayedFor":{},"prayerCounts":{},"answeredCounts":{},"pendingDesire":null,"openPrayers":[],"thought":"Waking up.","stats":{"prayers":0,"answered":0,"meals":0,"nights":0,"shifts":0,"conversations":0}},{"id":"tam","pos":{"x":10,"y":27},"prev":{"x":10,"y":27},"path":[],"action":null,"needs":{"hunger":72,"thirst":68,"energy":80,"social":60,"comfort":65,"spirit":55},"inventory":[],"memories":[{"tick":-1,"day":0,"time":"before","text":"The river at night. I was four. I remember being carried away from the bank, not toward it.","kind":"grief","weight":10,"seed":true,"i":0},{"tick":-1,"day":0,"time":"before","text":"Eating at a different house every night for six years. Everyone was kind. Nobody was mine.","kind":"origin","weight":9,"seed":true,"i":1},{"tick":-1,"day":0,"time":"before","text":"The water-wheel turning for the first time. It ran eight days. Best eight days.","kind":"joy","weight":8,"seed":true,"i":2},{"tick":-1,"day":0,"time":"before","text":"Bram let me sharpen his scythe once and said it was \"not bad\". I think about that a lot.","kind":"joy","weight":6,"seed":true,"i":3}],"relationships":{"bram":45,"odile":45},"pressure":{},"prayedFor":{},"prayerCounts":{},"answeredCounts":{},"pendingDesire":null,"openPrayers":[],"thought":"Waking up.","stats":{"prayers":0,"answered":0,"meals":0,"nights":0,"shifts":0,"conversations":0}}],"houses":{"house_bram":{"larder":30,"warmth":60,"repair":85},"house_odile":{"larder":30,"warmth":60,"repair":85},"house_tam":{"larder":30,"warmth":60,"repair":85}},"village":{"granary":70,"fieldYield":60,"wellWater":85,"firewood":30},"structures":[],"events":[]}
